(249281, 16332, 3290, '<td valign="top">Hmmm. Nice idea. For some reason, it doesn''t really work for me. Perhaps it''s the crop, perhaps it''s the colour. Not sure. Would be interested to see more shots on the same theme.</td>', 'Hmmm. Nice idea. For some reason, it doesn''t really work for me. Perhaps it''s the crop, perhaps it''s the colour. Not sure. Would be interested to see more shots on the same theme.', '2003-03-31 03:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
