(249293, 16529, 3290, '<td valign="top">A Galileo thermometer? Good idea, but it''s a little hard to tell what it is. Needs a less severe crop, perhaps? And perhaps a little less harsh lighting. The composition does give the sensation of dynamism (falling) though.</td>', 'A Galileo thermometer? Good idea, but it''s a little hard to tell what it is. Needs a less severe crop, perhaps? And perhaps a little less harsh lighting. The composition does give the sensation of dynamism (falling) though.', '2003-03-31 03:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
