(249374, 16572, 5865, '<td valign="top">This photograph really captured my attention.  The texture of the metal is beautiful to look at.  The image is very crisp, but I like the depth of field used too.  You''ve got my vote anyway - 10.</td>', 'This photograph really captured my attention.  The texture of the metal is beautiful to look at.  The image is very crisp, but I like the depth of field used too.  You''ve got my vote anyway - 10.', '2003-03-31 04:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(249376, 16687, 5865, '<td valign="top">I must say that I am not thrilled with the subject, but your use of lighting has made the photograph interesting - well done for that.</td>', 'I must say that I am not thrilled with the subject, but your use of lighting has made the photograph interesting - well done for that.', '2003-03-31 04:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(249379, 16764, 5865, '<td valign="top">Although the idea is very simple, I think the unusual background has made it a powerful shot with the reflection showing on the tweesers.  The depth of field adds interest and I like the way you have used the lighting.  Well done.</td>', 'Although the idea is very simple, I think the unusual background has made it a powerful shot with the reflection showing on the tweesers.  The depth of field adds interest and I like the way you have used the lighting.  Well done.', '2003-03-31 04:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(249424, 16295, 3540, '<td valign="top">Cute idea.  I don''t see this really as a macro so much but I think the idea is good and the exposure and framing are good.</td>', 'Cute idea.  I don''t see this really as a macro so much but I think the idea is good and the exposure and framing are good.', '2003-03-31 05:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(249425, 16325, 3540, '<td valign="top">Looks like its just a pinch out of focus.  Great idea.   I''d have framed this just a touch more to the right to bring the pin decisively beyond the halfway point</td>', 'Looks like its just a pinch out of focus.  Great idea.   I''d have framed this just a touch more to the right to bring the pin decisively beyond the halfway point', '2003-03-31 05:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(249426, 16678, 3540, '<td valign="top">These are some zip-strips with attitude.  Remarkable color.  nice idea.  The setup is good but I don''t really like the thing they are resting on.  I think it''d have rocked if it were black.</td>', 'These are some zip-strips with attitude.  Remarkable color.  nice idea.  The setup is good but I don''t really like the thing they are resting on.  I think it''d have rocked if it were black.', '2003-03-31 05:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(249427, 16310, 3540, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what this is, but its pretty cool.  Looks like something leftover from 3 mile island though.  Great exposure and color.  For some stupid reason it reminds me of S''mores.</td>', 'I don''t know what this is, but its pretty cool.  Looks like something leftover from 3 mile island though.  Great exposure and color.  For some stupid reason it reminds me of S''mores.', '2003-03-31 05:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(249428, 16509, 3540, '<td valign="top">I don''t really like the ghosty effects on this pic.  I''m not sure how they were created but I''m putting my money on some kind of light source.   I think the framing would''ve been better moving the subject a little more to the right.</td>', 'I don''t really like the ghosty effects on this pic.  I''m not sure how they were created but I''m putting my money on some kind of light source.   I think the framing would''ve been better moving the subject a little more to the right.', '2003-03-31 05:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(249430, 16393, 3540, '<td valign="top">There is some distortion going on with this pic that may be on purpose but I''m guessing its from oversaturating the reds in this photo.  Stunning image looking at the subject but the background is really grainy.  The grain however makes it look like a photo from the 70s.  Interesting pic.  Good luck</td>', 'There is some distortion going on with this pic that may be on purpose but I''m guessing its from oversaturating the reds in this photo.  Stunning image looking at the subject but the background is really grainy.  The grain however makes it look like a photo from the 70s.  Interesting pic.  Good luck', '2003-03-31 05:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(249432, 16764, 3540, '<td valign="top">Very shallow DOF.  Can''t make up my mind if I like it that way or not.  The very center of the photo is focused.  I think it''d have been more successful with a bigger f number and a greater DOF so at least the point of the instrument were focused.   I like the framing however I think the subject is a little overexposed.</td>', 'Very shallow DOF.  Can''t make up my mind if I like it that way or not.  The very center of the photo is focused.  I think it''d have been more successful with a bigger f number and a greater DOF so at least the point of the instrument were focused.   I like the framing however I think the subject is a little overexposed.', '2003-03-31 06:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(249435, 16692, 5728, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea, and you really pulled it off well. 10 out of 10 from me.</td>', 'Excellent idea, and you really pulled it off well. 10 out of 10 from me.', '2003-03-31 06:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(249436, 16258, 3540, '<td valign="top">Great idea but the execution just isn''t there.  Were this one if focus, I think you could add a whole point to your final score.  Unfortunately it isn''t.</td>', 'Great idea but the execution just isn''t there.  Were this one if focus, I think you could add a whole point to your final score.  Unfortunately it isn''t.', '2003-03-31 06:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(249439, 16180, 3540, '<td valign="top">This has a very oil painting look to it.  Unusual colors but nice earthy tones.</td>', 'This has a very oil painting look to it.  Unusual colors but nice earthy tones.', '2003-03-31 06:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(249440, 16692, 3540, '<td valign="top">WOW factor has kicked in finally.  Great photo.  I like the framing the exposure the stop action, the clarity.  Great vision for a shot and executed nicely.  My first 10 of the week.  Come to think of it I''ve given no 9''s either.</td>', 'WOW factor has kicked in finally.  Great photo.  I like the framing the exposure the stop action, the clarity.  Great vision for a shot and executed nicely.  My first 10 of the week.  Come to think of it I''ve given no 9''s either.', '2003-03-31 06:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(249441, 16617, 3540, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the framing of this photo.  The subject is worthy and the lighting is good, I just think a more conventional approach to this would''ve been preferred.</td>', 'I don''t like the framing of this photo.  The subject is worthy and the lighting is good, I just think a more conventional approach to this would''ve been preferred.', '2003-03-31 06:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(249447, 16492, 3540, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but I don''t see this being a macro.  Nice shot though</td>', 'Good idea, but I don''t see this being a macro.  Nice shot though', '2003-03-31 06:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(249448, 16461, 3540, '<td valign="top">I think this one needs quite a bit more exposure.  Good clarity of photo, just not quite bright enough.</td>', 'I think this one needs quite a bit more exposure.  Good clarity of photo, just not quite bright enough.', '2003-03-31 06:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(249449, 16621, 3540, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  Well conceived, well setup, nicely captured.  I don''t like how the nuts look a little dull, like they were tarnished, but a great shot. - 9<br/></td>', 'Nice image.  Well conceived, well setup, nicely captured.  I don''t like how the nuts look a little dull, like they were tarnished, but a great shot. - 9', '2003-03-31 06:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(249450, 16264, 3540, '<td valign="top">I''ve been meaning to try this out.  I hope I can do as well as this one.  A little bit underexposed but very sharp and very crisp</td>', 'I''ve been meaning to try this out.  I hope I can do as well as this one.  A little bit underexposed but very sharp and very crisp', '2003-03-31 06:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(249451, 16302, 3540, '<td valign="top">I think this shot is sort of deceiving in that it obviously is focused on one end and the other end is not.  but the framing makes it look like it should be in focus.  I think you should''ve made the angle going away from the camera more obvious.  I was thinking that when the top of the page loaded but when I go to the bottom, you did what I was thinking actually, just it isn''t emphasized enough.  almost!</td>', 'I think this shot is sort of deceiving in that it obviously is focused on one end and the other end is not.  but the framing makes it look like it should be in focus.  I think you should''ve made the angle going away from the camera more obvious.  I was thinking that when the top of the page loaded but when I go to the bottom, you did what I was thinking actually, just it isn''t emphasized enough.  almost!', '2003-03-31 06:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(249452, 16542, 3540, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting.  I''m feeling suddenly thirsty...  Nothing but coffee for me this morning tho. Good shot</td>', 'Nice lighting.  I''m feeling suddenly thirsty...  Nothing but coffee for me this morning tho. Good shot', '2003-03-31 06:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(249454, 16763, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is a good idea, which you turned into a great shot! It looks like it is dancing with one leg up in the air. Amazing colors you''ve brought out there. Definitely worth a 10!</td>', 'This is a good idea, which you turned into a great shot! It looks like it is dancing with one leg up in the air. Amazing colors you''ve brought out there. Definitely worth a 10!', '2003-03-31 06:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
