(249461, 16715, 6458, '<td valign="top">Okay.. You get a good store just for having a simpsons monopoly set. Plus it''s a great macro shot as well means 9 from me.</td>', 'Okay.. You get a good store just for having a simpsons monopoly set. Plus it''s a great macro shot as well means 9 from me.', '2003-03-31 07:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(249464, 16264, 1829, '<td valign="top">Excellent macro shot.  I like a creative mind and you have certainly achieved it here.  Technically flawless:  Clarity, texture, lighting, dof and composition are just awesome.  I really like how the water droplets look three dimentional.  Again an excellent shot and GL in this weeks challenge.</td>', 'Excellent macro shot.  I like a creative mind and you have certainly achieved it here.  Technically flawless:  Clarity, texture, lighting, dof and composition are just awesome.  I really like how the water droplets look three dimentional.  Again an excellent shot and GL in this weeks challenge.', '2003-03-31 07:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(249466, 16571, 1829, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition and choice of subject to photograph.  Love the b&amp;w here with only the red colour coming through.  Very well thought through.  Nice job and GL in this weeks challenge.</td>', 'Excellent composition and choice of subject to photograph.  Love the b&w here with only the red colour coming through.  Very well thought through.  Nice job and GL in this weeks challenge.', '2003-03-31 07:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(249467, 16715, 1829, '<td valign="top">Very well achieved.  I love the subject and the tone of the complete image.  Excellent work.  GL in this weeks challenge.</td>', 'Very well achieved.  I love the subject and the tone of the complete image.  Excellent work.  GL in this weeks challenge.', '2003-03-31 07:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
