(249485, 16264, 2344, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what the point of this is.  We''ve been seeing entirely too much of this technique in the challenges, and lately they''ve been doing better than they should. Sorry.  You should try a subject with more impact... something with more shape and more colour.</td>', 'I''m not sure what the point of this is.  We''ve been seeing entirely too much of this technique in the challenges, and lately they''ve been doing better than they should. Sorry.  You should try a subject with more impact... something with more shape and more colour.', '2003-03-31 08:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
