(249519, 16335, 6999, '<td valign="top">Captured the texture well - looks kind of synthetic, and the colour is strong. Doesn''t do anything much for me beyond being a good shot technically.</td>', 'Captured the texture well - looks kind of synthetic, and the colour is strong. Doesn''t do anything much for me beyond being a good shot technically.', '2003-03-31 09:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(249521, 16760, 6999, '<td valign="top">Too much contrast for me - really want to see this where the highlights aren''t so bright and the shadows so deep. Good shot though - but it says over-processed to me, rather than being a quite beautiful simple study of decaying beauty.</td>', 'Too much contrast for me - really want to see this where the highlights aren''t so bright and the shadows so deep. Good shot though - but it says over-processed to me, rather than being a quite beautiful simple study of decaying beauty.', '2003-03-31 09:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(249525, 16715, 6999, '<td valign="top">Jeez, there''s a Simpson''s branded Monopoly? Nice shot - except that Bart''s a little too far out of frame, whereas the house is on the strong line, but not the point of focus. Pulls the eye two ways.</td>', 'Jeez, there''s a Simpson''s branded Monopoly? Nice shot - except that Bart''s a little too far out of frame, whereas the house is on the strong line, but not the point of focus. Pulls the eye two ways.', '2003-03-31 09:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(249530, 16693, 6999, '<td valign="top">This really doesn seem very dark - and I like dark shots, and my monitor is set up OK. Not sure that the pile of money is going to be well-recieved though.</td>', 'This really doesn seem very dark - and I like dark shots, and my monitor is set up OK. Not sure that the pile of money is going to be well-recieved though.', '2003-03-31 09:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(249533, 16462, 6999, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, I can''t get away from the border - find it hugely distracting in such a simple shot. Also I think there''s a lack of detail here - such a simple composition needs something extraordinary (whether it be focus, light, or whatever), and that just isn''t here: 4</td>', 'I''m sorry, I can''t get away from the border - find it hugely distracting in such a simple shot. Also I think there''s a lack of detail here - such a simple composition needs something extraordinary (whether it be focus, light, or whatever), and that just isn''t here: 4', '2003-03-31 09:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(249536, 16332, 6999, '<td valign="top">Can''t decide whether I love or loathe this shot. Excellent composition, but the colouration is bothering me. 5 for now ...</td>', 'Can''t decide whether I love or loathe this shot. Excellent composition, but the colouration is bothering me. 5 for now ...', '2003-03-31 09:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(249540, 16543, 6999, '<td valign="top">The focus seems to be fractionally out - just behind the eye, rather than on it. People''s eyes are always drawn to animals eyes ...</td>', 'The focus seems to be fractionally out - just behind the eye, rather than on it. People''s eyes are always drawn to animals eyes ...', '2003-03-31 09:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(249546, 16039, 6999, '<td valign="top">ha! was going to try this and never got round to it. Possible focus issue? ;-)</td>', 'ha! was going to try this and never got round to it. Possible focus issue? ;-)', '2003-03-31 09:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(249550, 16580, 6999, '<td valign="top">Oh thank God, a decent photograph. Might be a little over-exposed, certainly some of the white has flared out. Really captured the texture though</td>', 'Oh thank God, a decent photograph. Might be a little over-exposed, certainly some of the white has flared out. Really captured the texture though', '2003-03-31 09:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(249552, 16382, 6999, '<td valign="top">Other than the border (which I really dislike), top shooting.</td>', 'Other than the border (which I really dislike), top shooting.', '2003-03-31 09:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(249553, 16325, 6999, '<td valign="top">Is the focus fractionally out? Not quite sharp (ahem) enough for me.</td>', 'Is the focus fractionally out? Not quite sharp (ahem) enough for me.', '2003-03-31 09:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(249554, 16747, 6999, '<td valign="top">I find the light-source a little distracting - a pity, as the leaf''s semi-transparency is fascinatiing.</td>', 'I find the light-source a little distracting - a pity, as the leaf''s semi-transparency is fascinatiing.', '2003-03-31 09:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(249555, 16159, 6999, '<td valign="top">I think you''ve gone too far on the soft-focus thing. Diffusion, whatever it is. Would have been a top shot otherwise.</td>', 'I think you''ve gone too far on the soft-focus thing. Diffusion, whatever it is. Would have been a top shot otherwise.', '2003-03-31 09:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(249559, 16770, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice catch. Great sparks. Great colours. Good sharpness. Very well done. My only suggestion would be a tighter crop on the left.</td>', 'Nice catch. Great sparks. Great colours. Good sharpness. Very well done. My only suggestion would be a tighter crop on the left.', '2003-03-31 10:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(249560, 16463, 3290, '<td valign="top">Like the colours, sharpness, composition, everything. Would have been perfect with a little catchlight or refelection in the lens of the glasses though.</td>', 'Like the colours, sharpness, composition, everything. Would have been perfect with a little catchlight or refelection in the lens of the glasses though.', '2003-03-31 10:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(249562, 16765, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice macro. Just a little over exposed at the top left of the coin. Of course, this may have been the effect you were looking for, but I''d prefer it toned down just a little.</td>', 'Nice macro. Just a little over exposed at the top left of the coin. Of course, this may have been the effect you were looking for, but I''d prefer it toned down just a little.', '2003-03-31 10:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(249565, 16045, 3290, '<td valign="top">Pretty, but a little soft. Perhaps a little unsharp mask would help?</td>', 'Pretty, but a little soft. Perhaps a little unsharp mask would help?', '2003-03-31 10:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(249566, 16496, 3290, '<td valign="top">Cool. Looks like a jet engine or something. Good subject, nice composition.</td>', 'Cool. Looks like a jet engine or something. Good subject, nice composition.', '2003-03-31 10:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(249567, 16601, 3290, '<td valign="top">If you''re going to show the bottom of the candle, I think you need to show the top too.</td>', 'If you''re going to show the bottom of the candle, I think you need to show the top too.', '2003-03-31 10:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(249569, 16647, 3290, '<td valign="top">Great subject, sharpness and composition. Well done.</td>', 'Great subject, sharpness and composition. Well done.', '2003-03-31 10:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(249570, 16079, 3290, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective on toilet rool. Novel.</td>', 'Interesting perspective on toilet rool. Novel.', '2003-03-31 10:05:36.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(249571, 16325, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice colours and composition. If you included the pin head, we''d be able to tell what it is without the title.</td>', 'Nice colours and composition. If you included the pin head, we''d be able to tell what it is without the title.', '2003-03-31 10:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(249572, 16579, 3290, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but a bit soft.</td>', 'Interesting, but a bit soft.', '2003-03-31 10:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(249573, 16692, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice. Shame you missed the bottom of the flame. Good idea. How many shots did you take before you caught it?</td>', 'Nice. Shame you missed the bottom of the flame. Good idea. How many shots did you take before you caught it?', '2003-03-31 10:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(249574, 16546, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice subject, nice title, but needs more DOF. Try a narrower aperture.</td>', 'Nice subject, nice title, but needs more DOF. Try a narrower aperture.', '2003-03-31 10:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(249575, 16760, 3290, '<td valign="top">It certainly is. I like this one, it has a dry, withered feel to it. Well done.</td>', 'It certainly is. I like this one, it has a dry, withered feel to it. Well done.', '2003-03-31 10:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(249576, 16524, 3290, '<td valign="top">Hmmm. Bit hard to tell what it is. Perhaps it would work better in colour?</td>', 'Hmmm. Bit hard to tell what it is. Perhaps it would work better in colour?', '2003-03-31 10:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(249578, 16650, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice subject and pretty sharp, but looks overexposed (or have you played with the levels/contrast?)</td>', 'Nice subject and pretty sharp, but looks overexposed (or have you played with the levels/contrast?)', '2003-03-31 10:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(249580, 16542, 3290, '<td valign="top">Good lighting. Not sure about the composition. I think I want to see the neck of the bottle.</td>', 'Good lighting. Not sure about the composition. I think I want to see the neck of the bottle.', '2003-03-31 10:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(249581, 16039, 3290, '<td valign="top">Ha ha. But too soft.</td>', 'Ha ha. But too soft.', '2003-03-31 10:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(249582, 16731, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice. Needs more contrast, I think.</td>', 'Nice. Needs more contrast, I think.', '2003-03-31 10:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(249584, 16535, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, colours and textures. But leaves you wondering what it is.</td>', 'Nice composition, colours and textures. But leaves you wondering what it is.', '2003-03-31 10:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(249585, 16543, 3290, '<td valign="top">Good subject. Would look great on a lily pad.</td>', 'Good subject. Would look great on a lily pad.', '2003-03-31 10:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(249587, 16382, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice colours, nice composition. I would squeeze them together a little more.</td>', 'Nice colours, nice composition. I would squeeze them together a little more.', '2003-03-31 10:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(249588, 16178, 3290, '<td valign="top">Good textures and colours. Would be better if sharp throughout.</td>', 'Good textures and colours. Would be better if sharp throughout.', '2003-03-31 10:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(249589, 16462, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice. I like it. Olive looks a little dry.</td>', 'Nice. I like it. Olive looks a little dry.', '2003-03-31 10:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(249590, 16633, 3290, '<td valign="top">Great composition and lighting. Nice one.</td>', 'Great composition and lighting. Nice one.', '2003-03-31 10:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(249591, 16551, 3290, '<td valign="top">A little too busy.</td>', 'A little too busy.', '2003-03-31 10:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(249592, 16158, 3290, '<td valign="top">A little too bright.</td>', 'A little too bright.', '2003-03-31 10:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(249593, 16681, 3290, '<td valign="top">Pretty and nicely lit. But I want to see all of that rightmost petal. Also, crop out some of the empty space above.</td>', 'Pretty and nicely lit. But I want to see all of that rightmost petal. Also, crop out some of the empty space above.', '2003-03-31 10:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(249601, 16601, 6025, '<td valign="top">Ooh. Very creative indeed. well seen. (9)</td>', 'Ooh. Very creative indeed. well seen. (9)', '2003-03-31 10:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(249605, 16655, 6025, '<td valign="top">I would have voted this higher f it had been a Logitech mouse. Can''t stand Microsoft ;) Just kidding. An OK macro shot, but it could do with some better DOF. Also, the burnt out area to the left of the image is slightly disturbing. (6)</td>', 'I would have voted this higher f it had been a Logitech mouse. Can''t stand Microsoft ;) Just kidding. An OK macro shot, but it could do with some better DOF. Also, the burnt out area to the left of the image is slightly disturbing. (6)', '2003-03-31 10:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(249608, 16545, 6025, '<td valign="top">Very creative, but it looks out of focus to me... and sharpness is really the alpha and omega of macro. Sorry. (4)</td>', 'Very creative, but it looks out of focus to me... and sharpness is really the alpha and omega of macro. Sorry. (4)', '2003-03-31 10:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(249610, 16771, 6025, '<td valign="top">I want more DOF! Nice corkscrew though, and nice lighting.  (5)</td>', 'I want more DOF! Nice corkscrew though, and nice lighting.  (5)', '2003-03-31 10:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(249613, 16332, 6025, '<td valign="top">Cool idea, but the colours look significantly out of whack. (5)</td>', 'Cool idea, but the colours look significantly out of whack. (5)', '2003-03-31 10:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(249615, 16483, 6025, '<td valign="top">Very cool, but the dust around the mirror (?) the noise in the image and the fact that the flowers themselves are out of focus pulls this down to a 4</td>', 'Very cool, but the dust around the mirror (?) the noise in the image and the fact that the flowers themselves are out of focus pulls this down to a 4', '2003-03-31 10:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(249616, 16347, 6025, '<td valign="top">A nice photograph, but not exactly macro, imho. (3)</td>', 'A nice photograph, but not exactly macro, imho. (3)', '2003-03-31 10:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(249619, 16492, 6025, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and execution, but not macro. (3)</td>', 'Nice lighting and execution, but not macro. (3)', '2003-03-31 10:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(249620, 16039, 6025, '<td valign="top">Hahaha.. That''s funny ;) Too bad the picture itself is out of focus. (3)</td>', 'Hahaha.. That''s funny ;) Too bad the picture itself is out of focus. (3)', '2003-03-31 10:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(249623, 16750, 6025, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but overexposed in the middle and too much noise in the picture (4)</td>', 'Nice idea, but overexposed in the middle and too much noise in the picture (4)', '2003-03-31 10:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(249624, 16497, 6025, '<td valign="top">A pretty shot, but not quite macro. (4)</td>', 'A pretty shot, but not quite macro. (4)', '2003-03-31 10:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(249626, 16576, 6025, '<td valign="top">A beautiful and creative shot, but not exactly what I see as macro. (3)</td>', 'A beautiful and creative shot, but not exactly what I see as macro. (3)', '2003-03-31 10:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(249627, 16643, 6025, '<td valign="top">Pretty, but over exposed on the men itself, and too much digital noise in the pen split and on the edges of curves. (6)</td>', 'Pretty, but over exposed on the men itself, and too much digital noise in the pen split and on the edges of curves. (6)', '2003-03-31 10:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(249636, 16622, 772, '<td valign="top">very nice macro... the detail and depth of field are excellent... I think it would be even better if the microphone was turned to an angle... great shot :) - setzler</td>', 'very nice macro... the detail and depth of field are excellent... I think it would be even better if the microphone was turned to an angle... great shot :) - setzler', '2003-03-31 10:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(249643, 16509, 772, '<td valign="top">amazing photo... the softness of this shot is phenomenal and the curves are enticing... GREAT shot :) = 10 - setzler</td>', 'amazing photo... the softness of this shot is phenomenal and the curves are enticing... GREAT shot :) = 10 - setzler', '2003-03-31 10:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(249645, 16621, 772, '<td valign="top">very nice study of patterns here.. the only improvement i could suggest woudl be either going to black and white or making some white balance adjustments to remove the yellow tint.... nice work though :) - setzler</td>', 'very nice study of patterns here.. the only improvement i could suggest woudl be either going to black and white or making some white balance adjustments to remove the yellow tint.... nice work though :) - setzler', '2003-03-31 10:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(249646, 16405, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a neat shot and I like the blue tint... the centered composition doesn''t seem to work as well for me though... - setzler</td>', 'This is a neat shot and I like the blue tint... the centered composition doesn''t seem to work as well for me though... - setzler', '2003-03-31 10:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(249652, 16313, 772, '<td valign="top">nice abstract... the color and patterns here work very well... - setzler</td>', 'nice abstract... the color and patterns here work very well... - setzler', '2003-03-31 10:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(249656, 16302, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice macro idea, but the tonal range is a little flat for my own taste.. i think it could use a little more light on the subject and maybe a darker background to set it off... just my personal taste :) - setzler</td>', 'This is a very nice macro idea, but the tonal range is a little flat for my own taste.. i think it could use a little more light on the subject and maybe a darker background to set it off... just my personal taste :) - setzler', '2003-03-31 10:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(249659, 16264, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent shot :)  I think a little more light would create some more contrast and really make this photo punch hard... great work :) - setzler</td>', 'excellent shot :)  I think a little more light would create some more contrast and really make this photo punch hard... great work :) - setzler', '2003-03-31 11:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(249671, 16159, 772, '<td valign="top">beautiful job with the softness and blur in this shot... The only improvement I think you could make would be to have a larger image... excellent work :) - setzler</td>', 'beautiful job with the softness and blur in this shot... The only improvement I think you could make would be to have a larger image... excellent work :) - setzler', '2003-03-31 11:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(249674, 16382, 772, '<td valign="top">I think this is a beautiful shot, but the border bugs me terribly... it''s blending in with the color of your pink flowers and it creates discontinuity in the image for me... - setzler</td>', 'I think this is a beautiful shot, but the border bugs me terribly... it''s blending in with the color of your pink flowers and it creates discontinuity in the image for me... - setzler', '2003-03-31 11:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(249676, 16542, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent product shot... the creative lighting works very well :) - setzler</td>', 'excellent product shot... the creative lighting works very well :) - setzler', '2003-03-31 11:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(249681, 16693, 772, '<td valign="top">I think this shot woudl be a lot stronger with some more light or some creative lighting... it''s just to dark overall for my taste... - setzler</td>', 'I think this shot woudl be a lot stronger with some more light or some creative lighting... it''s just to dark overall for my taste... - setzler', '2003-03-31 11:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(249682, 16742, 675, '<td valign="top">cool shot sher.  nice detail on the body of the camera. the lighting is a bit hot on the top of the camera, but it also blends nicely with the color. good job</td>', 'cool shot sher.  nice detail on the body of the camera. the lighting is a bit hot on the top of the camera, but it also blends nicely with the color. good job', '2003-03-31 11:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(249684, 16742, 772, '<td valign="top">this is a great composition, but I think the yellow tint could be improved with some white balance settings possibly... nice shot :) - setzler</td>', 'this is a great composition, but I think the yellow tint could be improved with some white balance settings possibly... nice shot :) - setzler', '2003-03-31 11:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(249688, 16461, 772, '<td valign="top">this is a nice shot but some of the detail is lost in the darkness... I think some backlighting would achieve the effect you were looking for here... a dark image is good, but some backlight would help with the ''rider'' on this one... nice work :) - setzler</td>', 'this is a nice shot but some of the detail is lost in the darkness... I think some backlighting would achieve the effect you were looking for here... a dark image is good, but some backlight would help with the ''rider'' on this one... nice work :) - setzler', '2003-03-31 11:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(249734, 16764, 1344, '<td valign="top">Cool photo..  What is the surface it''s on top of?  Think I would have liked it more if the business tip of the tweezer (the tip) was in sharp focus, rather than the grip.</td>', 'Cool photo..  What is the surface it''s on top of?  Think I would have liked it more if the business tip of the tweezer (the tip) was in sharp focus, rather than the grip.', '2003-03-31 11:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
