(249835, 16609, 6328, '<td valign="top">So, did you use colour lighting here?  It looks great!  Nice close focus, good and sharp too, I like the way you can see the nails in the bottom.  Your thin black framing suits this photograph.</td>', 'So, did you use colour lighting here?  It looks great!  Nice close focus, good and sharp too, I like the way you can see the nails in the bottom.  Your thin black framing suits this photograph.', '2003-03-31 12:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(249842, 16405, 6328, '<td valign="top">Really nice job of capturing this young fellow!  I''m enjoying the colours on his back. I''d be interested in knowing what you used for lighting purposes.  Was it white or . . .  It''s good lighting by the way, good focus, nice and crisp and clear.<br/>MY only dislikes are the dark corner, bottom right and the top left, thought perhaps you could have continued your lighting all the way up in those areas or continuity.</td>', 'Really nice job of capturing this young fellow!  I''m enjoying the colours on his back. I''d be interested in knowing what you used for lighting purposes.  Was it white or . . .  It''s good lighting by the way, good focus, nice and crisp and clear.MY only dislikes are the dark corner, bottom right and the top left, thought perhaps you could have continued your lighting all the way up in those areas or continuity.', '2003-03-31 12:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(249845, 16647, 4536, '<td valign="top">Cutie, love the tongue. He''s got a bit of an eye bogger that I wish you had cleaned out before shooting, also wish both eyes were completely focused. Otherwise a great, fun shot.</td>', 'Cutie, love the tongue. He''s got a bit of an eye bogger that I wish you had cleaned out before shooting, also wish both eyes were completely focused. Otherwise a great, fun shot.', '2003-03-31 12:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(249847, 16731, 5391, '<td valign="top">Wonderful focus and nice tones.  I''m partial to b/w flower shots that bring out the beauty of the form of the flower, rather than focus on the flower''s color, as so many do.  The softness is gorgeous.  I prefer for the tones in b/w shots to run from true black to true white, but somehow the muted grays work really well with this.  9</td>', 'Wonderful focus and nice tones.  I''m partial to b/w flower shots that bring out the beauty of the form of the flower, rather than focus on the flower''s color, as so many do.  The softness is gorgeous.  I prefer for the tones in b/w shots to run from true black to true white, but somehow the muted grays work really well with this.  9', '2003-03-31 12:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(249857, 16264, 1344, '<td valign="top">Sorry, this technique is getting old..  Seeing one of these in just about every challenge.  Nice execution, but I gotta drop a couple points for originality :)</td>', 'Sorry, this technique is getting old..  Seeing one of these in just about every challenge.  Nice execution, but I gotta drop a couple points for originality :)', '2003-03-31 12:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
