(251001, 16313, 5767, '<td valign="top">Critique: a little grainy and a bit overexposed (on my monitor at least)<br/>Praise: Fun entry.  Its abstractness is not distracting and the colors and lines here are well composed.  There is a lot to look at here to keep my eyes interested.</td>', 'Critique: a little grainy and a bit overexposed (on my monitor at least)Praise: Fun entry.  Its abstractness is not distracting and the colors and lines here are well composed.  There is a lot to look at here to keep my eyes interested.', '2003-04-01 00:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(251002, 16517, 4793, '<td valign="top">Beautiful flower, I think that you would have a more wow shot if you had framed this shot closer in and left off one or both of the side flowers that you can''t see well. Your border blends in nicely with the greenery. Try shooting your flowers again close up, I see more possibilities here. Good luck.</td>', 'Beautiful flower, I think that you would have a more wow shot if you had framed this shot closer in and left off one or both of the side flowers that you can''t see well. Your border blends in nicely with the greenery. Try shooting your flowers again close up, I see more possibilities here. Good luck.', '2003-04-01 01:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(251003, 16678, 6600, '<td valign="top">Go figure.... next challenge is ''color''.  Great color here.  (In this particular shot, my preference would have been to have the tie-straps in focus thoughout the shot).  I know..... half like it this way, half like it another way.  Just can''t win can we?  It really is a matter of personal preference (I think).</td>', 'Go figure.... next challenge is ''color''.  Great color here.  (In this particular shot, my preference would have been to have the tie-straps in focus thoughout the shot).  I know..... half like it this way, half like it another way.  Just can''t win can we?  It really is a matter of personal preference (I think).', '2003-04-01 01:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(251004, 16764, 5767, '<td valign="top">Excellent!  The narrow tonal range in this image really accents the textures and shapes.  Good use of depth of focus.   This is a very interesting image.</td>', 'Excellent!  The narrow tonal range in this image really accents the textures and shapes.  Good use of depth of focus.   This is a very interesting image.', '2003-04-01 01:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
