(251012, 16164, 5767, '<td valign="top">Critique: All lines lead my eyes outside of the image rather than into it.  This just makes it harder to stay "inside" the picture. <br/>Praise: Great colors, sharp focus and obvious attention to detail makes this a very appealing image overall.  I like it.</td>', 'Critique: All lines lead my eyes outside of the image rather than into it.  This just makes it harder to stay "inside" the picture. Praise: Great colors, sharp focus and obvious attention to detail makes this a very appealing image overall.  I like it.', '2003-04-01 01:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(251014, 16681, 5767, '<td valign="top">Critique:  Macro?  Leaf cut off on the side is also a bit distracting.<br/>Praise:  Wonderful shadows and detail throughout.  Black background really lets the subject stand out and be noticed.  Color saturation is excellent and the lighting is very well done.  Overall this is nicely done.</td>', 'Critique:  Macro?  Leaf cut off on the side is also a bit distracting.Praise:  Wonderful shadows and detail throughout.  Black background really lets the subject stand out and be noticed.  Color saturation is excellent and the lighting is very well done.  Overall this is nicely done.', '2003-04-01 01:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(251017, 16099, 5767, '<td valign="top">Fun entry.  Great two color combination.  Interesting lines going in all directions and your use of depth of focus really brings my eyes slamming into the center of the image - every time they try to leave they get drawn back to the middle. Well done.</td>', 'Fun entry.  Great two color combination.  Interesting lines going in all directions and your use of depth of focus really brings my eyes slamming into the center of the image - every time they try to leave they get drawn back to the middle. Well done.', '2003-04-01 01:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(251018, 16224, 4793, '<td valign="top">That is a nice rock, I would like to see the back ground all white. I find the black at the top of the photo a bit distracting, it is competing with the focal point of your photo.</td>', 'That is a nice rock, I would like to see the back ground all white. I find the black at the top of the photo a bit distracting, it is competing with the focal point of your photo.', '2003-04-01 01:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
