(251129, 16172, 5767, '<td valign="top">Interesting image - the lines and circles really make this a "better than most" image.  The lighting and sharpness also add a lot.  Maybe a little out of focus on the edges, but not too big of a deal.</td>', 'Interesting image - the lines and circles really make this a "better than most" image.  The lighting and sharpness also add a lot.  Maybe a little out of focus on the edges, but not too big of a deal.', '2003-04-01 02:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
