(251138, 16580, 5767, '<td valign="top">Definitely a macro submission.  Texture and color accuracy here are excellent.  So is the lighting.</td>', 'Definitely a macro submission.  Texture and color accuracy here are excellent.  So is the lighting.', '2003-04-01 02:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
