(251148, 16760, 5767, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  The leaves curling up really look like a frazzled, stressed out person''s hair might.  The lighting is good and the sharpness is also very well executed.  The contrastyness (probably not a real word) adds to the overall work you''ve done.</td>', 'Nicely done.  The leaves curling up really look like a frazzled, stressed out person''s hair might.  The lighting is good and the sharpness is also very well executed.  The contrastyness (probably not a real word) adds to the overall work you''ve done.', '2003-04-01 02:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(251149, 16463, 6600, '<td valign="top">Brass or gold color?  Brass I assume.  Quite a royal looking composition with the bright magenta color.  Very nice detail!</td>', 'Brass or gold color?  Brass I assume.  Quite a royal looking composition with the bright magenta color.  Very nice detail!', '2003-04-01 02:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(251150, 16229, 6405, '<td valign="top">Would be much better if was one color background, the green is distracting from the subject 6 here!</td>', 'Would be much better if was one color background, the green is distracting from the subject 6 here!', '2003-04-01 02:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(251151, 16655, 5767, '<td valign="top">Good abstract and macro.</td>', 'Good abstract and macro.', '2003-04-01 02:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(251152, 16310, 5767, '<td valign="top">Captured my eyes and imagination.  The lighting, cropping and "feeling" of this really work well.</td>', 'Captured my eyes and imagination.  The lighting, cropping and "feeling" of this really work well.', '2003-04-01 02:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(251153, 16264, 5767, '<td valign="top">Executed well.  Good exposure, lighting and of course you''ve accomplished your goal well.</td>', 'Executed well.  Good exposure, lighting and of course you''ve accomplished your goal well.', '2003-04-01 02:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(251156, 16764, 6600, '<td valign="top">Can we say sterile....    Looks like it was left behind.  A very clean and sterile looking shot.  Decent composition.</td>', 'Can we say sterile....    Looks like it was left behind.  A very clean and sterile looking shot.  Decent composition.', '2003-04-01 02:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(251160, 16713, 6600, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred the pearls standing out in a brilliant white color (though maybe not possible, look like silver pearls).  Nice detail, decent composition.</td>', 'I would have preferred the pearls standing out in a brilliant white color (though maybe not possible, look like silver pearls).  Nice detail, decent composition.', '2003-04-01 02:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(251163, 16154, 6523, '<td valign="top">A good idea for a macro and a nice photo!</td>', 'A good idea for a macro and a nice photo!', '2003-04-01 02:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(251164, 16747, 6600, '<td valign="top">The backlight and holder itself distracts from the leaf (in my amateur opinion).</td>', 'The backlight and holder itself distracts from the leaf (in my amateur opinion).', '2003-04-01 02:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(251168, 16484, 5767, '<td valign="top">Good colors and lighting.</td>', 'Good colors and lighting.', '2003-04-01 02:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(251170, 16633, 6600, '<td valign="top">Neat shot!  Go Twins!  I really like the lighting and composition!  Great job!</td>', 'Neat shot!  Go Twins!  I really like the lighting and composition!  Great job!', '2003-04-01 02:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(251180, 16473, 6600, '<td valign="top">Looks mighty refreshing !  I can nearly taste this shot.  Nice detail and color (though I think the super ''clear'' ice cubes would have given this a improved look, maybe).</td>', 'Looks mighty refreshing !  I can nearly taste this shot.  Nice detail and color (though I think the super ''clear'' ice cubes would have given this a improved look, maybe).', '2003-04-01 02:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(251327, 16770, 3540, '<td valign="top">The background is good.  The framing is great.  The sparks are a very dynamic addition.  Just a little washed out on the left side of the flame.  Solid 9<br/></td>', 'The background is good.  The framing is great.  The sparks are a very dynamic addition.  Just a little washed out on the left side of the flame.  Solid 9', '2003-04-01 05:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(251328, 16196, 3540, '<td valign="top">Good DOF.  The center crop works for this pic.  I like the way some of the pennies are tarnished a bit, some a lot, and some not at all.  Gives this a little more realism.  I would''ve gotten a brand new shiny quarter for the picture though.  Great idea.</td>', 'Good DOF.  The center crop works for this pic.  I like the way some of the pennies are tarnished a bit, some a lot, and some not at all.  Gives this a little more realism.  I would''ve gotten a brand new shiny quarter for the picture though.  Great idea.', '2003-04-01 05:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(251331, 16692, 3900, '<td valign="top">Great capture, but I want to see the whole flame!</td>', 'Great capture, but I want to see the whole flame!', '2003-04-01 05:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(251332, 16623, 3540, '<td valign="top">I think the framing works for this, but the focus doesn''t.  I think it would''ve been better to make the DOF greater so that some of the bubbles were in focus.  Nice idea.  The wand looks slightly out of focus too.</td>', 'I think the framing works for this, but the focus doesn''t.  I think it would''ve been better to make the DOF greater so that some of the bubbles were in focus.  Nice idea.  The wand looks slightly out of focus too.', '2003-04-01 05:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(251334, 16770, 3900, '<td valign="top">Great capture of the sparks.  I wonder if you could have done this without fluid so you only see the sparks without the that bright flame?  All the sparks would stand out better that way.</td>', 'Great capture of the sparks.  I wonder if you could have done this without fluid so you only see the sparks without the that bright flame?  All the sparks would stand out better that way.', '2003-04-01 05:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(251335, 16129, 3540, '<td valign="top">I''d have drawn a lot tighter to the subject on this shot.  I don''t know if I''d really call this a macro.  The B&amp;W was a good choice for this photo.  THe lighting is also really well done.   I think my biggest issue is that this isn''t relaly a close enough shot.</td>', 'I''d have drawn a lot tighter to the subject on this shot.  I don''t know if I''d really call this a macro.  The B&W was a good choice for this photo.  THe lighting is also really well done.   I think my biggest issue is that this isn''t relaly a close enough shot.', '2003-04-01 05:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(251336, 16715, 3540, '<td valign="top">White balance needs adjusting on this photo.  The little bart is cute, but doesn''t do it for me as a subject for a photo.  Neat little figure though.</td>', 'White balance needs adjusting on this photo.  The little bart is cute, but doesn''t do it for me as a subject for a photo.  Neat little figure though.', '2003-04-01 05:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(251337, 16594, 3540, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the mirror for a backdrop on this particular photo.  The water really makes this image somewhat dynamic.  Good idea to add that in</td>', 'I don''t like the mirror for a backdrop on this particular photo.  The water really makes this image somewhat dynamic.  Good idea to add that in', '2003-04-01 05:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(251338, 16748, 3540, '<td valign="top">Great color.  I''d have closed the distance on this subject though.  Its just not taken from close enough.<br/></td>', 'Great color.  I''d have closed the distance on this subject though.  Its just not taken from close enough.', '2003-04-01 06:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(251340, 16750, 3900, '<td valign="top">Nice, but I would prefer to see the edge of the pile on at least one side.</td>', 'Nice, but I would prefer to see the edge of the pile on at least one side.', '2003-04-01 06:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(251342, 16302, 3900, '<td valign="top">Need to get a better lighting scheme on this and more DOF wouldn''t hurt either.</td>', 'Need to get a better lighting scheme on this and more DOF wouldn''t hurt either.', '2003-04-01 06:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(251343, 16505, 3540, '<td valign="top">Great colors and framing.  The lighting is pretty good but I think you could''ve used just a little more.  Nice job</td>', 'Great colors and framing.  The lighting is pretty good but I think you could''ve used just a little more.  Nice job', '2003-04-01 06:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(251345, 16601, 3540, '<td valign="top">The flame on the candle is a little overexposed.  Nice candle btw.  I also wouldn''t have cut off the top of the glass for this photo either.</td>', 'The flame on the candle is a little overexposed.  Nice candle btw.  I also wouldn''t have cut off the top of the glass for this photo either.', '2003-04-01 06:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(251350, 16462, 3540, '<td valign="top">Don''t like the green around the frame.  Solid photo.  Well taken and great color portrayal</td>', 'Don''t like the green around the frame.  Solid photo.  Well taken and great color portrayal', '2003-04-01 06:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(251352, 16759, 3900, '<td valign="top">That white spot doesn''t look natural ... looks too solid to be a reflection, and it extends into the eyelid.  How can that be?</td>', 'That white spot doesn''t look natural ... looks too solid to be a reflection, and it extends into the eyelid.  How can that be?', '2003-04-01 06:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(251353, 16684, 3540, '<td valign="top">Great colors.  Exceptional photo quality and a very creative photo.  Outstanding! 9 from me</td>', 'Great colors.  Exceptional photo quality and a very creative photo.  Outstanding! 9 from me', '2003-04-01 06:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(251354, 16759, 3540, '<td valign="top">The highlight on the eye really looks like it doesn''t belong there.  Good concept for a photo and very well done.</td>', 'The highlight on the eye really looks like it doesn''t belong there.  Good concept for a photo and very well done.', '2003-04-01 06:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(251355, 16579, 3900, '<td valign="top">Nice rustic look, with just the right amount of grain.</td>', 'Nice rustic look, with just the right amount of grain.', '2003-04-01 06:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(251356, 16045, 3540, '<td valign="top">Good colors.  Love the lighting.  Not particularly fond of flower macros unless they are very well done.  I like this one :)  8</td>', 'Good colors.  Love the lighting.  Not particularly fond of flower macros unless they are very well done.  I like this one :)  8', '2003-04-01 06:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(251357, 16382, 3540, '<td valign="top">I think that if you''d have focused on one, maybe 2 flowers I''d be more likely to consider this a macro.  I think it was taken a little too far back or not cropped tight enough.  The colors are very good (I am a Minnesota vikings fan and these are their colors)  but I''d like this more were it tighter</td>', 'I think that if you''d have focused on one, maybe 2 flowers I''d be more likely to consider this a macro.  I think it was taken a little too far back or not cropped tight enough.  The colors are very good (I am a Minnesota vikings fan and these are their colors)  but I''d like this more were it tighter', '2003-04-01 06:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(251359, 16763, 3540, '<td valign="top">Very funny shot.  Extraordinary photo quality on this one.  I''d have framed it just a pinch to the left, but what do I know?  The detail is incredible - 10</td>', 'Very funny shot.  Extraordinary photo quality on this one.  I''d have framed it just a pinch to the left, but what do I know?  The detail is incredible - 10', '2003-04-01 06:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(251360, 16733, 3540, '<td valign="top">The light at the top of the frame is too bright.  I''m not sure if it was flash or not, but it looks like it.  The rest of it looks okay except for the mallet being out of focus at the bottom.  Good work</td>', 'The light at the top of the frame is too bright.  I''m not sure if it was flash or not, but it looks like it.  The rest of it looks okay except for the mallet being out of focus at the bottom.  Good work', '2003-04-01 06:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(251361, 16159, 3540, '<td valign="top">Too hazy for me.  I like soft, but this one exceeds that by quite a bit.  The photo size is not really helping matters either</td>', 'Too hazy for me.  I like soft, but this one exceeds that by quite a bit.  The photo size is not really helping matters either', '2003-04-01 06:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(251364, 16496, 3540, '<td valign="top">This lacks that real crispness that makes macros a special type of shot.  Good idea but not quite executed as well as I''d hoped</td>', 'This lacks that real crispness that makes macros a special type of shot.  Good idea but not quite executed as well as I''d hoped', '2003-04-01 06:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(251366, 16650, 3540, '<td valign="top">A little washed out.  Pretty good colors though.</td>', 'A little washed out.  Pretty good colors though.', '2003-04-01 06:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(251379, 16576, 7561, '<td valign="top">Absolutely stunning use of color. Simply beautiful!</td>', 'Absolutely stunning use of color. Simply beautiful!', '2003-04-01 07:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(251380, 16693, 7561, '<td valign="top">A clever idea with a strong reminder attached. Good work!</td>', 'A clever idea with a strong reminder attached. Good work!', '2003-04-01 07:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(251384, 16509, 1829, '<td valign="top">You have surely captured a beautiful shot.  Wonderful colour, softness and composition.  Very well done.  GL in this weeks challenge.</td>', 'You have surely captured a beautiful shot.  Wonderful colour, softness and composition.  Very well done.  GL in this weeks challenge.', '2003-04-01 07:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(251386, 16681, 1829, '<td valign="top">I just love the lighting technique in which you have achieved.  Colour, clarity and composition are just awesome.  Excellent photo and GL in this weeks challenge.</td>', 'I just love the lighting technique in which you have achieved.  Colour, clarity and composition are just awesome.  Excellent photo and GL in this weeks challenge.', '2003-04-01 07:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(251389, 16462, 1829, '<td valign="top">Composition, colour and clarity are just awesome.  I really like the shadow and the choice of subject.  The framing works well here too.  Excellent shot.  GL in this weeks challenge.</td>', 'Composition, colour and clarity are just awesome.  I really like the shadow and the choice of subject.  The framing works well here too.  Excellent shot.  GL in this weeks challenge.', '2003-04-01 07:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(251391, 16574, 1829, '<td valign="top">I really like how you have achieved the blured vision around your main subject.  Excellent lighting, composition, framing and choice of subject.  Very well done.  GL in this weeks challenge.</td>', 'I really like how you have achieved the blured vision around your main subject.  Excellent lighting, composition, framing and choice of subject.  Very well done.  GL in this weeks challenge.', '2003-04-01 07:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(251393, 16332, 1829, '<td valign="top">The colours and clarity grabbed me on this shot.  I really like the composition, clarity, colours (of course) and dof.  A well thought through macro shot which deserves a high mark.  Excellent work and GL in this weeks challenge.</td>', 'The colours and clarity grabbed me on this shot.  I really like the composition, clarity, colours (of course) and dof.  A well thought through macro shot which deserves a high mark.  Excellent work and GL in this weeks challenge.', '2003-04-01 07:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(251396, 16440, 1829, '<td valign="top">Very well done.  I like how you have used the whole frame to capture these greens.  Clarity, colour and choice of subject is excellent.  Great job.  GL in this weeks challenge.</td>', 'Very well done.  I like how you have used the whole frame to capture these greens.  Clarity, colour and choice of subject is excellent.  Great job.  GL in this weeks challenge.', '2003-04-01 07:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(251399, 16760, 1829, '<td valign="top">Clarity, lighting, and choice of subject is excellent.  Nice to see a withered flower than a ''pretty'' one for a change.  Very well done and GL in this weeks challenge.</td>', 'Clarity, lighting, and choice of subject is excellent.  Nice to see a withered flower than a ''pretty'' one for a change.  Very well done and GL in this weeks challenge.', '2003-04-01 07:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(251443, 16684, 342, '<td valign="top">Nice photo for this weeks challege as well.</td>', 'Nice photo for this weeks challege as well.', '2003-04-01 09:33:07.000000', NULL, 1);
