(251446, 16129, 6551, '<td valign="top">NICE!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!! :P</td>', 'NICE!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!! :P', '2003-04-01 09:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(251507, 16678, 7658, '<td valign="top">Excellent detail, gorgeous color.  Could be ad advertisement.</td>', 'Excellent detail, gorgeous color.  Could be ad advertisement.', '2003-04-01 11:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(251549, 16750, 6504, '<td valign="top">The black and whites are very good!  Very good lighting, nice sharp focus in front. Overall very good.</td>', 'The black and whites are very good!  Very good lighting, nice sharp focus in front. Overall very good.', '2003-04-01 12:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(251554, 16347, 6504, '<td valign="top">Nice clean sink!  The shot is good, but it could be just a little more in focus.  I wonder if you had used lighting on both sides if it would improve things.  (Backlighting the spigotand eliminate the shadows)</td>', 'Nice clean sink!  The shot is good, but it could be just a little more in focus.  I wonder if you had used lighting on both sides if it would improve things.  (Backlighting the spigotand eliminate the shadows)', '2003-04-01 12:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(251557, 16771, 1344, '<td valign="top">Super shot..  Great lighting and focus.  Like the shallow DOF, but would have liked to be able to make out just a LITTLE more of the "screw" part of the corkscrew.  It IS the most important part IMO..  8</td>', 'Super shot..  Great lighting and focus.  Like the shallow DOF, but would have liked to be able to make out just a LITTLE more of the "screw" part of the corkscrew.  It IS the most important part IMO..  8', '2003-04-01 12:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(251563, 16172, 6328, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, lots of blue, good lighting effect.</td>', 'Nice shot, lots of blue, good lighting effect.', '2003-04-01 12:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(251566, 16045, 6328, '<td valign="top">Lovely flower to just sit and look at.  The colors are magnificent and you''ve caught them just wonderfully. Lighting is great as is the focus. I like your choice of framing with the (gold?) inside.  My one concern on flowers is why people cut off petals when they crop. Why not include the whole flower to enjoy?  It''s a beautul flower, why ruin it. . .</td>', 'Lovely flower to just sit and look at.  The colors are magnificent and you''ve caught them just wonderfully. Lighting is great as is the focus. I like your choice of framing with the (gold?) inside.  My one concern on flowers is why people cut off petals when they crop. Why not include the whole flower to enjoy?  It''s a beautul flower, why ruin it. . .', '2003-04-01 12:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(251570, 16687, 6328, '<td valign="top">Nice color of yellow when the light hits it, shows nice on the green also.  Good focus, the light gives good shadow also.</td>', 'Nice color of yellow when the light hits it, shows nice on the green also.  Good focus, the light gives good shadow also.', '2003-04-01 12:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(251571, 16545, 6328, '<td valign="top">Nice orange and yellow colors, gives off a nice visual effect.  I especially like your framing also.  Just can''t figure out what it is.</td>', 'Nice orange and yellow colors, gives off a nice visual effect.  I especially like your framing also.  Just can''t figure out what it is.', '2003-04-01 12:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(251579, 16597, 6328, '<td valign="top">Nice clarity, good color, good background, lighting seems fine.<br/>One earring seems opened up a bit and the other is tightly closed, could you not have fixed this?  And what is that little white spot just below the earring on the black background?  You''ve also lost the lighting on the gold siding on the right side of the earring on the Right Earring.  Nice photo, but you have to watch out for these points in future.  Don''t take me as being negative, just trying to help out.<br/>Silver Fox.</td>', 'Nice clarity, good color, good background, lighting seems fine.One earring seems opened up a bit and the other is tightly closed, could you not have fixed this?  And what is that little white spot just below the earring on the black background?  You''ve also lost the lighting on the gold siding on the right side of the earring on the Right Earring.  Nice photo, but you have to watch out for these points in future.  Don''t take me as being negative, just trying to help out.Silver Fox.', '2003-04-01 12:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(251583, 16748, 6328, '<td valign="top">Really great idea for this Challenge.  Nice colours.  Good focus to a point.  Did you fade out on the right on purpose? Because it''s all out of focus over there and on the bottom from the yellow pin on down.</td>', 'Really great idea for this Challenge.  Nice colours.  Good focus to a point.  Did you fade out on the right on purpose? Because it''s all out of focus over there and on the bottom from the yellow pin on down.', '2003-04-01 12:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
