(254883, 16717, 1717, '<td valign="top">very emotional photo.  i like the color.  the crop is a little too tight on the thumb, but i love that the red, white and blue bracelet is included in the shot.  good work.</td>', 'very emotional photo.  i like the color.  the crop is a little too tight on the thumb, but i love that the red, white and blue bracelet is included in the shot.  good work.', '2003-04-06 00:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
