(254890, 16576, 1717, '<td valign="top">very nice!  the lighting is a bit hot in the upper right corner and there is a small, somewhat distracting reflection in the glass, but the colors are amazing!</td>', 'very nice!  the lighting is a bit hot in the upper right corner and there is a small, somewhat distracting reflection in the glass, but the colors are amazing!', '2003-04-06 00:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
