(254903, 16643, 6325, '<td valign="top">Good tones and composition. I wish the lighting wereless harsh across the name on the nib.</td>', 'Good tones and composition. I wish the lighting wereless harsh across the name on the nib.', '2003-04-06 01:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(254904, 16284, 6325, '<td valign="top">I always have a hard time doing African violet photos - the surface is so shiny. I think if you look at the other flower shots in this challenge you will see notable differences in the area of composition and choice of background, focus acros the subject, and attention to detail such at the shadows across the flower. Keep up the good work.</td>', 'I always have a hard time doing African violet photos - the surface is so shiny. I think if you look at the other flower shots in this challenge you will see notable differences in the area of composition and choice of background, focus acros the subject, and attention to detail such at the shadows across the flower. Keep up the good work.', '2003-04-06 01:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(254905, 16765, 3317, '<td valign="top">just a little bright on the upper left, the kind of thing a slight change in angle might''ve corrected. like the ''reflection'' in the foreground. nice.</td>', 'just a little bright on the upper left, the kind of thing a slight change in angle might''ve corrected. like the ''reflection'' in the foreground. nice.', '2003-04-06 01:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(254906, 16462, 6325, '<td valign="top">Good detail through out. I like the composition. The shadow is a nice touch.</td>', 'Good detail through out. I like the composition. The shadow is a nice touch.', '2003-04-06 01:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(254907, 16681, 3317, '<td valign="top">nice texture, good colors.</td>', 'nice texture, good colors.', '2003-04-06 01:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(254908, 16579, 3317, '<td valign="top">rust and age are great. wants to be just a little sharper.</td>', 'rust and age are great. wants to be just a little sharper.', '2003-04-06 01:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(254909, 16405, 3317, '<td valign="top">bummer by the time the votes are in this creature''s lifespan will probably be over.</td>', 'bummer by the time the votes are in this creature''s lifespan will probably be over.', '2003-04-06 01:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(254910, 16045, 3317, '<td valign="top">shadows on the petals get you an extra point, eight for you.</td>', 'shadows on the petals get you an extra point, eight for you.', '2003-04-06 01:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(254911, 16154, 3317, '<td valign="top">yeah! could look at this for a long time. way to capture something familiar in a new light, up close it looks like some alien world. or something.</td>', 'yeah! could look at this for a long time. way to capture something familiar in a new light, up close it looks like some alien world. or something.', '2003-04-06 01:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(254912, 16539, 6325, '<td valign="top">The pink color is vibrant and I like th eway the petals have movement. The center of the flower takes up so much of the image and does not have the impact of the pink.</td>', 'The pink color is vibrant and I like th eway the petals have movement. The center of the flower takes up so much of the image and does not have the impact of the pink.', '2003-04-06 01:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(254913, 16332, 3317, '<td valign="top">real real nice. good crop.</td>', 'real real nice. good crop.', '2003-04-06 01:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(254914, 16258, 3317, '<td valign="top">doesn''t show the kind of intense detail that your obviously decent macro lens is capable of. nice pattern, could use some more rich texture.</td>', 'doesn''t show the kind of intense detail that your obviously decent macro lens is capable of. nice pattern, could use some more rich texture.', '2003-04-06 01:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(254915, 16580, 3317, '<td valign="top">ten for you. great texture. really works, i gotta stop voting now, go get a snack.</td>', 'ten for you. great texture. really works, i gotta stop voting now, go get a snack.', '2003-04-06 01:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(254916, 16726, 3317, '<td valign="top">wow, cool. this was a really good idea.</td>', 'wow, cool. this was a really good idea.', '2003-04-06 01:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(254917, 16164, 6325, '<td valign="top">Colors are strong. The jumbled composition doesn''t have much impact on me - I think this subject would have shown better with a highly structured layout - lineup and a stron side light maybe. Still, this is a pretty good image, but not set apart.</td>', 'Colors are strong. The jumbled composition doesn''t have much impact on me - I think this subject would have shown better with a highly structured layout - lineup and a stron side light maybe. Still, this is a pretty good image, but not set apart.', '2003-04-06 01:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(254918, 16039, 3317, '<td valign="top">real clever, too fuzzy.</td>', 'real clever, too fuzzy.', '2003-04-06 01:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(254919, 16597, 6325, '<td valign="top">Prettu earrings. I don''t think the composition does them justice - it seems haphazard. I also notice what looks like noise in the background. I had this problem when I did long exposures. I cleaned up the image in Photoshop with the noise filter for dust and scratch which is legal. I later found out that my camera has a "long exposure noise filter" as a custom setting and that also clears it up. You might check on one of these two methods.</td>', 'Prettu earrings. I don''t think the composition does them justice - it seems haphazard. I also notice what looks like noise in the background. I had this problem when I did long exposures. I cleaned up the image in Photoshop with the noise filter for dust and scratch which is legal. I later found out that my camera has a "long exposure noise filter" as a custom setting and that also clears it up. You might check on one of these two methods.', '2003-04-06 01:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(254920, 16621, 6325, '<td valign="top">I would expect to see snappier highlights from the metal surfaces.</td>', 'I would expect to see snappier highlights from the metal surfaces.', '2003-04-06 01:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(254921, 16733, 6325, '<td valign="top">Good detail. I like the lighting in the lowerportion, but  the top is too bright and out of balance. A diffuser might help.</td>', 'Good detail. I like the lighting in the lowerportion, but  the top is too bright and out of balance. A diffuser might help.', '2003-04-06 01:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(254926, 16609, 4007, '<td valign="top">The clarity and detail is great.  The colorful highlights seem to add character as well. Good work. 8</td>', 'The clarity and detail is great.  The colorful highlights seem to add character as well. Good work. 8', '2003-04-06 02:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(254927, 16747, 4007, '<td valign="top">The ring of the light source in the background seems to detract from this shot a lot.</td>', 'The ring of the light source in the background seems to detract from this shot a lot.', '2003-04-06 02:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(254928, 16161, 4007, '<td valign="top">It has a nice abstract feel to it.</td>', 'It has a nice abstract feel to it.', '2003-04-06 02:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(254932, 16461, 4007, '<td valign="top">As a rule I don''t like figurine shots.. but this seems to be an exception.  I like the lighting on this shot a lot.  The dark slick feel of this shot really appeals to me.  Nice work.</td>', 'As a rule I don''t like figurine shots.. but this seems to be an exception.  I like the lighting on this shot a lot.  The dark slick feel of this shot really appeals to me.  Nice work.', '2003-04-06 04:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
