(254988, 16580, 3540, '<td valign="top">I thought this looked pretty silly at first.  I''ve reconsidered.  The contrast between the marshmallow stuff and the background and/or chocolate is great.  The texture is fabulous.  I never would''ve thought to do this.  what a great idea - 9</td>', 'I thought this looked pretty silly at first.  I''ve reconsidered.  The contrast between the marshmallow stuff and the background and/or chocolate is great.  The texture is fabulous.  I never would''ve thought to do this.  what a great idea - 9', '2003-04-06 10:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(254989, 16224, 3540, '<td valign="top">Looks like part of a geode.  Very nice subject but I don''t think you really capitalized on the wonderful colors as well as you could''ve.  I think the framing and lighting could use a little help.  I''d have made the piece of stone more in the middle and moved the light source up to shorten the shadow.  If the colors would''ve really shown on the present shadow, it might''ve been worth it but it only shows up as a couple of specs.  Nice photo, but I think it has a lot more potential</td>', 'Looks like part of a geode.  Very nice subject but I don''t think you really capitalized on the wonderful colors as well as you could''ve.  I think the framing and lighting could use a little help.  I''d have made the piece of stone more in the middle and moved the light source up to shorten the shadow.  If the colors would''ve really shown on the present shadow, it might''ve been worth it but it only shows up as a couple of specs.  Nice photo, but I think it has a lot more potential', '2003-04-06 10:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(254990, 16405, 3540, '<td valign="top">Pretty good DOF on this guy.  A little greater F and I think you''d have scored a little better.  I would''ve suggested a slightly tighter crop too.   Bring him a little closer to us.</td>', 'Pretty good DOF on this guy.  A little greater F and I think you''d have scored a little better.  I would''ve suggested a slightly tighter crop too.   Bring him a little closer to us.', '2003-04-06 10:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
