(254993, 16313, 3540, '<td valign="top">Couldn''t find anything more bright and colorful?  Nice subject and well taken photo.  The thing I noticed most was the light reflections on the yellow in front and the red in the back.  Nice shot though.</td>', 'Couldn''t find anything more bright and colorful?  Nice subject and well taken photo.  The thing I noticed most was the light reflections on the yellow in front and the red in the back.  Nice shot though.', '2003-04-06 10:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
