(255105, 16747, 6328, '<td valign="top">like the color of the place and the decaying maple leaf.  nice job.  good focus, your lighting os good also.</td>', 'like the color of the place and the decaying maple leaf.  nice job.  good focus, your lighting os good also.', '2003-04-06 12:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(255107, 16335, 6328, '<td valign="top">I''lll be watching ewe in the fewtere too! good focus, nice color.</td>', 'I''lll be watching ewe in the fewtere too! good focus, nice color.', '2003-04-06 12:48:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(255108, 16497, 6328, '<td valign="top">sharp lighting from the back and from top, nice red rosy tomatoes with the green vines on them still. good focus, the lighting gives off a nice shiny lighting on the table top too.</td>', 'sharp lighting from the back and from top, nice red rosy tomatoes with the green vines on them still. good focus, the lighting gives off a nice shiny lighting on the table top too.', '2003-04-06 12:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(255109, 16485, 6328, '<td valign="top">Nice lemony yellows here.  great color, good focus, good lighting too.</td>', 'Nice lemony yellows here.  great color, good focus, good lighting too.', '2003-04-06 12:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(255110, 16164, 6328, '<td valign="top">hmm.  lots of color here, good sharp focus, nice lighting too.</td>', 'hmm.  lots of color here, good sharp focus, nice lighting too.', '2003-04-06 12:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(255111, 16601, 6328, '<td valign="top">it''s an okay picture of a candle.  lots of bubble in the candle.  some color, some lighting coming down from the top.  I would like to have seen some of the lit wick for contrast and flare, you cropped the top off when perhaps you should have shown the top instead of the bottom.</td>', 'it''s an okay picture of a candle.  lots of bubble in the candle.  some color, some lighting coming down from the top.  I would like to have seen some of the lit wick for contrast and flare, you cropped the top off when perhaps you should have shown the top instead of the bottom.', '2003-04-06 12:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(255112, 16681, 6328, '<td valign="top">nice shot of this beautiful lady.  nice yellows peeking out at us, great focus, good lighting, good choice of background.</td>', 'nice shot of this beautiful lady.  nice yellows peeking out at us, great focus, good lighting, good choice of background.', '2003-04-06 12:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(255113, 16332, 6328, '<td valign="top">good colors, good lighting? good focus?  I don''t know, I think it''s too close for me to say.  It all looks out of focus to me.</td>', 'good colors, good lighting? good focus?  I don''t know, I think it''s too close for me to say.  It all looks out of focus to me.', '2003-04-06 12:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(255114, 16692, 6328, '<td valign="top">great strike!  nice color, good focus at the time of flame. And I must say: Good Lighting!</td>', 'great strike!  nice color, good focus at the time of flame. And I must say: Good Lighting!', '2003-04-06 12:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(255115, 16471, 6328, '<td valign="top">Very unusual Title that you''ve left.  Love the various peace signs on the scissors. Good lighting, good focus, shows good color on the handle and the usage through time/age. Good choice of framing.</td>', 'Very unusual Title that you''ve left.  Love the various peace signs on the scissors. Good lighting, good focus, shows good color on the handle and the usage through time/age. Good choice of framing.', '2003-04-06 12:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(255116, 16678, 6328, '<td valign="top">good macro shot, good color, good lighting too.</td>', 'good macro shot, good color, good lighting too.', '2003-04-06 12:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(255117, 16180, 6328, '<td valign="top">looks lonesome.  some good color shows through. lighting is okay. focus is good</td>', 'looks lonesome.  some good color shows through. lighting is okay. focus is good', '2003-04-06 13:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(255118, 16623, 6328, '<td valign="top">nice colors, good focus on the bubble maker only, good lighting</td>', 'nice colors, good focus on the bubble maker only, good lighting', '2003-04-06 13:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(255119, 16629, 6328, '<td valign="top">some nice color, good focus on the end of the dart only, fair lighting</td>', 'some nice color, good focus on the end of the dart only, fair lighting', '2003-04-06 13:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(255120, 16572, 6328, '<td valign="top">good focus and lighting, really nice macro shot.</td>', 'good focus and lighting, really nice macro shot.', '2003-04-06 13:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(255121, 16154, 6328, '<td valign="top">lots of color here in the soap.  lots of bubbles too.  shows good focus.  and nice lighting from the top.</td>', 'lots of color here in the soap.  lots of bubbles too.  shows good focus.  and nice lighting from the top.', '2003-04-06 13:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(255123, 16594, 6328, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful colors on your subject. great lighting, good focus too. Lovely photography.  It''s too bad you cropped off his tail, or you would have had more points.</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful colors on your subject. great lighting, good focus too. Lovely photography.  It''s too bad you cropped off his tail, or you would have had more points.', '2003-04-06 13:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(255127, 16543, 1128, '<td valign="top">Good detail and texture.</td>', 'Good detail and texture.', '2003-04-06 13:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(255128, 16601, 1128, '<td valign="top">I love the light on the bubbles in this one.  I have found that macro shots really tend to emphasize little details and with that said, you might have wanted to clean the top of the candle before taking this shot.</td>', 'I love the light on the bubbles in this one.  I have found that macro shots really tend to emphasize little details and with that said, you might have wanted to clean the top of the candle before taking this shot.', '2003-04-06 13:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(255129, 16509, 1128, '<td valign="top">I like the soft focus of this-- it matches the subject and the color scheme.</td>', 'I like the soft focus of this-- it matches the subject and the color scheme.', '2003-04-06 13:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(255131, 16770, 1128, '<td valign="top">OOh-  Great capture with the sparks and everything!  Nice job!</td>', 'OOh-  Great capture with the sparks and everything!  Nice job!', '2003-04-06 13:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(255132, 16471, 1128, '<td valign="top">This is a very poignant message (and subtle, which I like).  FYI: It doesn''t really fit the macro category to me-- seems more like a still life.</td>', 'This is a very poignant message (and subtle, which I like).  FYI: It doesn''t really fit the macro category to me-- seems more like a still life.', '2003-04-06 13:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(255133, 16692, 1128, '<td valign="top">Great capture!  I love the way that the wooden part of the match fades into darkness.</td>', 'Great capture!  I love the way that the wooden part of the match fades into darkness.', '2003-04-06 13:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(255134, 16462, 1128, '<td valign="top">Good shadow and I like the framing effect.</td>', 'Good shadow and I like the framing effect.', '2003-04-06 13:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(255136, 16229, 1128, '<td valign="top">You seemed to have captured all the necessary elements of shaving in this one.  I like the details-- it was clear that you put some thought into this one.  Good work.</td>', 'You seemed to have captured all the necessary elements of shaving in this one.  I like the details-- it was clear that you put some thought into this one.  Good work.', '2003-04-06 13:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(255137, 16492, 1128, '<td valign="top">I like the shadow and the lighting in this one.  FYI- this does not really seem like a macro to me-- more like a still life.</td>', 'I like the shadow and the lighting in this one.  FYI- this does not really seem like a macro to me-- more like a still life.', '2003-04-06 13:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(255138, 16046, 1128, '<td valign="top">Good idea-- I wish the string was a little more focused.</td>', 'Good idea-- I wish the string was a little more focused.', '2003-04-06 13:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(255139, 16159, 1128, '<td valign="top">This is a good effort.  I think the focus is a little too soft for my taste.</td>', 'This is a good effort.  I think the focus is a little too soft for my taste.', '2003-04-06 13:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(255142, 16068, 1128, '<td valign="top">This one is my favorite in terms of perspective.  Even the "expression" on the bug''s "face" is terrific!</td>', 'This one is my favorite in terms of perspective.  Even the "expression" on the bug''s "face" is terrific!', '2003-04-06 13:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(255144, 16737, 1128, '<td valign="top">Great fingerprints!  A true macro.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Great fingerprints!  A true macro.  Nicely done.', '2003-04-06 13:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(255145, 16039, 1128, '<td valign="top">This one is quite blurry.  It might have been clearer if you took it from farther away and then cropped it closer.</td>', 'This one is quite blurry.  It might have been clearer if you took it from farther away and then cropped it closer.', '2003-04-06 13:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(255147, 16382, 1128, '<td valign="top">Nice contrasting colors and you were able to capture a great deal of detail in all the flowers.  Good!</td>', 'Nice contrasting colors and you were able to capture a great deal of detail in all the flowers.  Good!', '2003-04-06 13:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(255148, 16580, 1128, '<td valign="top">I think you can tell a lot about the quality of a food photo by how hungry it makes you.  My stomach is growling when I look at this.  good work!</td>', 'I think you can tell a lot about the quality of a food photo by how hungry it makes you.  My stomach is growling when I look at this.  good work!', '2003-04-06 13:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(255149, 16764, 1128, '<td valign="top">I like the different textures in this.</td>', 'I like the different textures in this.', '2003-04-06 13:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(255151, 16282, 1128, '<td valign="top">This is a true macro.  It seems a little over sharpened on my monitor.  I like the different colors and reflections.</td>', 'This is a true macro.  It seems a little over sharpened on my monitor.  I like the different colors and reflections.', '2003-04-06 13:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(255159, 16463, 772, '<td valign="top">The color in this shot is very powerful... The image quality is also great... I think the composition could possibly be a bit stronger with a little more diagonal orientation of the lenses maybe... great shot :) - setzler</td>', 'The color in this shot is very powerful... The image quality is also great... I think the composition could possibly be a bit stronger with a little more diagonal orientation of the lenses maybe... great shot :) - setzler', '2003-04-06 14:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(255161, 16284, 772, '<td valign="top">The detail in this photo is great and I actually like the light/shadow contrast... nice work :) - setzler</td>', 'The detail in this photo is great and I actually like the light/shadow contrast... nice work :) - setzler', '2003-04-06 14:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(255165, 16461, 4055, '<td valign="top">One of three favourites this week. Fantastic lighting. Good dof and focus. Composition can´´t be better. Perfect in b&amp;w. This is the kind of photo I like very much. Well done!</td>', 'One of three favourites this week. Fantastic lighting. Good dof and focus. Composition can´´t be better. Perfect in b&w. This is the kind of photo I like very much. Well done!', '2003-04-06 14:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(255167, 16559, 6900, '<td valign="top">Excellent colors and focus.  I don''t know what''s on the right, but I don''t like it at all.  I would have either put more of it in or cropped it completely.  9</td>', 'Excellent colors and focus.  I don''t know what''s on the right, but I don''t like it at all.  I would have either put more of it in or cropped it completely.  9', '2003-04-06 14:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(255169, 16633, 4055, '<td valign="top">One of three favourites this week. Fantastic lighting. Good dof and focus. Composition is good too. I like this one very much. Well done!</td>', 'One of three favourites this week. Fantastic lighting. Good dof and focus. Composition is good too. I like this one very much. Well done!', '2003-04-06 14:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(255170, 16463, 6900, '<td valign="top">I like the picture on first glance.  The purple background, especially that it''s not perfectly flat - make this picture stand out everytime I come back to look at this week''s entries.  The dark spot in the lower left is a bit distracting, but otherwise I love it.  9</td>', 'I like the picture on first glance.  The purple background, especially that it''s not perfectly flat - make this picture stand out everytime I come back to look at this week''s entries.  The dark spot in the lower left is a bit distracting, but otherwise I love it.  9', '2003-04-06 14:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(255172, 16441, 6900, '<td valign="top">The texture is there, but the soft focus doesn''t let it come out.  If you are trying to show smooth vs rough white then put the rough in focus so we can see even more distinction.  I like the artistic value of this, but I think the execution was poor.</td>', 'The texture is there, but the soft focus doesn''t let it come out.  If you are trying to show smooth vs rough white then put the rough in focus so we can see even more distinction.  I like the artistic value of this, but I think the execution was poor.', '2003-04-06 14:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(255173, 16405, 4055, '<td valign="top">One of three favourites this week. Fantastic lighting. Good dof and focus. Composition perhaps a little centered. Perfect in this blue tone. I like it very much. Well done!</td>', 'One of three favourites this week. Fantastic lighting. Good dof and focus. Composition perhaps a little centered. Perfect in this blue tone. I like it very much. Well done!', '2003-04-06 14:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(255175, 16545, 6900, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what the hell this is, but we''re VERY close to it...so you met the challenge...but again...wha??  Very bright, indiscernable image.</td>', 'I''m not sure what the hell this is, but we''re VERY close to it...so you met the challenge...but again...wha??  Very bright, indiscernable image.', '2003-04-06 14:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(255176, 16203, 6900, '<td valign="top">Subject is only moderately interesting - maybe better if there was interesting or dramatic lighting on it.  The focus is soft - perhaps a shot from a not-so-good-camera?</td>', 'Subject is only moderately interesting - maybe better if there was interesting or dramatic lighting on it.  The focus is soft - perhaps a shot from a not-so-good-camera?', '2003-04-06 14:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(255178, 16039, 6900, '<td valign="top">Poor focus - does your camera actually have a macro mode?  The subject is only somewhat interesting, but it looks fairly new to be that damaged - did you get broken into?  It''s clever, but...</td>', 'Poor focus - does your camera actually have a macro mode?  The subject is only somewhat interesting, but it looks fairly new to be that damaged - did you get broken into?  It''s clever, but...', '2003-04-06 14:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(255180, 16726, 6900, '<td valign="top">Excellent detail on the lighter.  The flame is abit overexposed, but ... what can ya do, it''s FIRE, right?  :)  Every week there''s a shot I absolutely do not like that does well - I think this is that shot this week...good luck!</td>', 'Excellent detail on the lighter.  The flame is abit overexposed, but ... what can ya do, it''s FIRE, right?  :)  Every week there''s a shot I absolutely do not like that does well - I think this is that shot this week...good luck!', '2003-04-06 14:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(255183, 16661, 6900, '<td valign="top">Interesting lighting - coming from the bottom up.<br/>Slightly uninteresting subject - maybe if more of the banana was in the pic?  Or the lighting on top was better?<br/>I don''t know if a banana is a great subject to take a ''macro'' of, because you can''t include the whole banana, etc.</td>', 'Interesting lighting - coming from the bottom up.Slightly uninteresting subject - maybe if more of the banana was in the pic?  Or the lighting on top was better?I don''t know if a banana is a great subject to take a ''macro'' of, because you can''t include the whole banana, etc.', '2003-04-06 14:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(255185, 16310, 6900, '<td valign="top">Interesting lighting - but seems a bit overdone.  The light on the near ...egg... is too much and the lighting on the rest seems too little.  Great focus on the near egg, though.</td>', 'Interesting lighting - but seems a bit overdone.  The light on the near ...egg... is too much and the lighting on the rest seems too little.  Great focus on the near egg, though.', '2003-04-06 14:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(255187, 16717, 6900, '<td valign="top">Touching photo - nice detail on the hand...I''d rather see the rest of the thumb and not have bitsNpieces cut off.  Also, the natural lighting is a good idea, but I think it should have been placed so as not to give such a reflection on the envelope.</td>', 'Touching photo - nice detail on the hand...I''d rather see the rest of the thumb and not have bitsNpieces cut off.  Also, the natural lighting is a good idea, but I think it should have been placed so as not to give such a reflection on the envelope.', '2003-04-06 14:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(255191, 16647, 6900, '<td valign="top">Cats, babies, flowers and sunsets - the four hardest things to shoot because it''s been done to death.  I love LOVE the tongue sticking out and the intent look in the cat''s eyes.  I don''t like the reflection - it''s very distracting.  Very nice looking cat and picture.  Tough subject - 9.</td>', 'Cats, babies, flowers and sunsets - the four hardest things to shoot because it''s been done to death.  I love LOVE the tongue sticking out and the intent look in the cat''s eyes.  I don''t like the reflection - it''s very distracting.  Very nice looking cat and picture.  Tough subject - 9.', '2003-04-06 14:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(255193, 16473, 6900, '<td valign="top">I''m finding it hard to critique a shot I gave a 9, but what if the background under the subject was a bit different?  Brighter?  Outdoors-y?  Like the drink was served at a bbq or something...this is great, but it doesn''t tell me anything - no story.</td>', 'I''m finding it hard to critique a shot I gave a 9, but what if the background under the subject was a bit different?  Brighter?  Outdoors-y?  Like the drink was served at a bbq or something...this is great, but it doesn''t tell me anything - no story.', '2003-04-06 14:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(255198, 16045, 6900, '<td valign="top">Ok - minor details: you clipped 4 of the 6 tips and you can\''t see the other 2.  I want to see this whole flower.  The actual shot is amazing and the colors, lighting are excellent - I don\''t like the shadows on the petal, but where to put them...*shrug*  Great shot. 9</td>', 'Ok - minor details: you clipped 4 of the 6 tips and you can\''t see the other 2.  I want to see this whole flower.  The actual shot is amazing and the colors, lighting are excellent - I don\''t like the shadows on the petal, but where to put them...*shrug*  Great shot. 9', '2003-04-06 14:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(255199, 16621, 6900, '<td valign="top">Great shots are great shots.  I wish there was something more to the bg than just black holes, but I''m not sure what.  This would have done well in 3 or 4 challenges - it''s a great shot.</td>', 'Great shots are great shots.  I wish there was something more to the bg than just black holes, but I''m not sure what.  This would have done well in 3 or 4 challenges - it''s a great shot.', '2003-04-06 14:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(255247, 16737, 772, '<td valign="top">beautiful photo... the reflection on the keys is really nice... good work :) - setzler</td>', 'beautiful photo... the reflection on the keys is really nice... good work :) - setzler', '2003-04-06 15:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(255256, 16727, 7607, '<td valign="top">The detail and color here are awsome. You''ve captured the personallity of this wonderful little one and the glint in the eye really well.</td>', 'The detail and color here are awsome. You''ve captured the personallity of this wonderful little one and the glint in the eye really well.', '2003-04-06 16:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(255258, 16647, 7607, '<td valign="top">So much personality here that you''ve captured well. The details and color are great.</td>', 'So much personality here that you''ve captured well. The details and color are great.', '2003-04-06 16:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(255259, 16346, 7607, '<td valign="top">Good detail and texture</td>', 'Good detail and texture', '2003-04-06 16:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(255260, 16713, 7607, '<td valign="top">Wonderful.Detail,texture and color are right on</td>', 'Wonderful.Detail,texture and color are right on', '2003-04-06 16:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(255261, 16284, 7607, '<td valign="top">The sparking detail is wonderful. I''d love to see this more abstract though from right side to center.</td>', 'The sparking detail is wonderful. I''d love to see this more abstract though from right side to center.', '2003-04-06 16:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(255263, 16760, 7607, '<td valign="top">In a field of beautiful flower macro''s this is brave,thought provoking and well done.I perfer flower shot to show alittle background so it doesn''t look like it''s hanging in space but in this case it''s just the right touch</td>', 'In a field of beautiful flower macro''s this is brave,thought provoking and well done.I perfer flower shot to show alittle background so it doesn''t look like it''s hanging in space but in this case it''s just the right touch', '2003-04-06 16:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(255265, 16168, 7607, '<td valign="top">I love your concept here and the shadowing  and light is very good.</td>', 'I love your concept here and the shadowing  and light is very good.', '2003-04-06 16:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(255266, 16203, 7607, '<td valign="top">Good color and nice subject but lacks detail. Maybe a different angle and sharper focus? Can''t seem to put my finger on it.Sorry</td>', 'Good color and nice subject but lacks detail. Maybe a different angle and sharper focus? Can''t seem to put my finger on it.Sorry', '2003-04-06 16:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(255268, 16154, 7607, '<td valign="top">I come back to this time and again trying to come up with a comment but can only come up with one. Awsome details. Well done</td>', 'I come back to this time and again trying to come up with a comment but can only come up with one. Awsome details. Well done', '2003-04-06 16:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(255269, 16509, 3981, '<td valign="top">This is without a doubt one of the most beautiful pictures I have ever seen. The soft, suble coloring is exquisite.  Composition is magnificent. Soft focus on the back side of the lily is perfect. The only photo I have made a part of my Favorites.  Beautifully done!!!!  Bitz</td>', 'This is without a doubt one of the most beautiful pictures I have ever seen. The soft, suble coloring is exquisite.  Composition is magnificent. Soft focus on the back side of the lily is perfect. The only photo I have made a part of my Favorites.  Beautifully done!!!!  Bitz', '2003-04-06 16:33:42.000000', NULL, 1);
