(255567, 16770, 1344, '<td valign="top">To everyone who thought this was some kind of miracle and couldn''t figure out how I did it --<br/> <br/>It was real easy..  Sit lighter on table, focus, turn off lights, 10 second exposure, hold lighter, strike, and move finger away.<br/> <br/>I was surprised that my finger didn''t show up.  Guess at the point my finger was there, everything was still too dark to expose it, at the point the light source (the flame) appeared, my finger was already gone.<br/> <br/>Thanks a lot everyone for the great comments and high votes!</td>', 'To everyone who thought this was some kind of miracle and couldn''t figure out how I did it -- It was real easy..  Sit lighter on table, focus, turn off lights, 10 second exposure, hold lighter, strike, and move finger away. I was surprised that my finger didn''t show up.  Guess at the point my finger was there, everything was still too dark to expose it, at the point the light source (the flame) appeared, my finger was already gone. Thanks a lot everyone for the great comments and high votes!', '2003-04-07 01:09:23.000000', NULL, 0),
