(255947, 16724, 6532, '<td valign="top">Wow - all these great comments - thank you to everyone who commented.  Can not believe I could only scored overall a 4.396.  The cactus is  actually this color.  But I do see how if you didn''t know the actual color of the cactus - it could be viewed as "over-exposed", "washed out" or harsh lighting.  The learning curve continues.</td>', 'Wow - all these great comments - thank you to everyone who commented.  Can not believe I could only scored overall a 4.396.  The cactus is  actually this color.  But I do see how if you didn''t know the actual color of the cactus - it could be viewed as "over-exposed", "washed out" or harsh lighting.  The learning curve continues.', '2003-04-07 06:47:01.000000', NULL, 0),
