(256409, 16715, 3599, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club.<br/> <br/>I think this may be my first one in three weeks so I may be a little rusty.  First off I really like the idea.  You got in close as well.  I think the two things I would do to improve this photo are lighting and subject matter.  I guess that is what you call the last one.  I will start with it.  I think Bart alone without the Alien game piece behind him would be better and less distractive.  Ok, the lighting is too yellow for me and a tad dark.  I do like that it is soft though.  I know sometimes it is difficult getting that happy medium of not too bright not too dark.  If anything I would have tried to change the color levels of the light.  Well that is really all I have.  I hope that it helped you a little.  Good work and good luck in future challenges.</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club. I think this may be my first one in three weeks so I may be a little rusty.  First off I really like the idea.  You got in close as well.  I think the two things I would do to improve this photo are lighting and subject matter.  I guess that is what you call the last one.  I will start with it.  I think Bart alone without the Alien game piece behind him would be better and less distractive.  Ok, the lighting is too yellow for me and a tad dark.  I do like that it is soft though.  I know sometimes it is difficult getting that happy medium of not too bright not too dark.  If anything I would have tried to change the color levels of the light.  Well that is really all I have.  I hope that it helped you a little.  Good work and good luck in future challenges.', '2003-04-07 12:05:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(256459, 16335, 368, '<td valign="top">oh well .. i really thought i would have done better .. this is actually a beanie .. not a regular stuffed animal ... next challenge - here i come :) .. thanks for all the comments though :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-04-09 00:24:22.</i></td>', 'oh well .. i really thought i would have done better .. this is actually a beanie .. not a regular stuffed animal ... next challenge - here i come :) .. thanks for all the comments though :)', '2003-04-07 12:30:27.000000', '2003-04-09 01:24:22.000000', 0),
(256556, 16713, 1280, '<td valign="top">These are real sugar snap pea pods.  I carefully opened this and placed pearls in it.  <br/>I tried photographing this under a light tent to soften the glare, but the pearls still took on the reflection of light. They also took on the green tone of the pods.  So I desaturated a the whole image a little to eliminate the green on the pearls.  Unfortunately it also washed out the green of the pods.  <br/>Thanks to all of you who commented.<br/></td>', 'These are real sugar snap pea pods.  I carefully opened this and placed pearls in it.  I tried photographing this under a light tent to soften the glare, but the pearls still took on the reflection of light. They also took on the green tone of the pods.  So I desaturated a the whole image a little to eliminate the green on the pearls.  Unfortunately it also washed out the green of the pods.  Thanks to all of you who commented.', '2003-04-07 13:13:06.000000', NULL, 0),
