(374917, 16771, 10842, '<td valign="top">Hi there<br/>I there some way you can prevent these shots to be blocked from being copied and printed?????<br/>Anyone could go ahead and use anywhere they wanted. I am wanting to download some photos but that would be holding me back.<br/>The question is...why would anyone buy them if they can just download , take to photoshop and print?<br/>What are the pros and cons on this Issue?<br/>Thanks<br/>Katy</td>', 'Hi thereI there some way you can prevent these shots to be blocked from being copied and printed?????Anyone could go ahead and use anywhere they wanted. I am wanting to download some photos but that would be holding me back.The question is...why would anyone buy them if they can just download , take to photoshop and print?What are the pros and cons on this Issue?ThanksKaty', '2003-08-03 02:43:28.000000', NULL, 0),
