(424195, 16594, 8125, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on a macro photo.  I really like how the lizard appears to be real by taking a drink.  I like the solid black, it makes the lizard stand out more.  The mirror underneath him is a nice touch.  I wish the tail weren''t chopped, I feel like I''m following the image up and being abruptly stopped.  There is some ''noise'' on the surface, maybe dust on the mirror, and that is distracting me.<br/> <br/>Overall, a nice shot and very good idea!</td>', 'Interesting take on a macro photo.  I really like how the lizard appears to be real by taking a drink.  I like the solid black, it makes the lizard stand out more.  The mirror underneath him is a nice touch.  I wish the tail weren''t chopped, I feel like I''m following the image up and being abruptly stopped.  There is some ''noise'' on the surface, maybe dust on the mirror, and that is distracting me. Overall, a nice shot and very good idea!', '2003-09-19 17:05:54.000000', NULL, 0),
